  <name>F-Contact</name>
  <summary>Lightweight contact manager built with FLTK and SQLite</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="es">Gestor de contactos ligero hecho con FLTK y SQLite</summary>

  <developer id="io.github.jhon_a_31alphabet">
    <name>Jhon A.</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>F-Contact is a fast and lightweight desktop application to manage your contacts.</p>
    <p>All data is stored in a local SQLite database, so no account and no network connection are required.</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Create, view, edit and delete contacts</li>
      <li>Search contacts by name or keyword and filter them by category</li>
      <li>User interface available in Spanish, English, French, Portuguese and Japanese</li>
      <li>Designed to run well on modest hardware</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.jhon_a_31alphabet.F-contact.desktop</launchable>

  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/Jhon-A-31alphabet/F-contact</url>
